<section class="page-head shell">
  <p class="eyebrow">CSPC CCIT service desk</p>
  <h1 class="page-head__title">Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="page-head__lede">This policy explains what Qampus stores about you, why it stores it, and who can see it. Qampus is a course project for CCIT 106.</p>
  <p class="page-head__lede">Last updated: 26 October 2026.</p>
</section>

<section class="section shell" aria-label="Privacy Policy">
  <ol class="steps">
    <li class="step">
      <p class="step__number">01</p>
      <h2 class="step__title">What we collect</h2>
      <p class="step__text">Your full name, student number, email, and password hash. A profile avatar if you upload one. The tickets you take. Audit rows for sign-ins and ticket changes. One session cookie while you stay signed in. When you set a password, we check it against the Pwned Passwords service using only the first five characters of a SHA-1 hash. The password itself never leaves the server.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="step">
      <p class="step__number">02</p>
      <h2 class="step__title">Why we collect it</h2>
      <p class="step__text">To run the queue, to match a ticket to a student at the counter, and to keep an audit trail of sign-ins and ticket changes. We do not use your data for marketing or advertising.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="step">
      <p class="step__number">03</p>
      <h2 class="step__title">Who sees it</h2>
      <p class="step__text">Signed-in staff and office heads can see the name on a ticket. The public display shows ticket code, service, counter, waiting count, and updated time only. It never shows a name, email, or student number.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="step">
      <p class="step__number">04</p>
      <h2 class="step__title">Cookies</h2>
      <p class="step__text">One session cookie, named cspc_queue.sid. It is httpOnly and sameSite lax. It keeps you signed in. There are no advertising or tracking cookies.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="step">
      <p class="step__number">05</p>
      <h2 class="step__title">How long we keep it</h2>
      <p class="step__text">Demo data is cleared by the demo reset. Audit rows stay for the demo. If a record is wrong, ask the CCIT office.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="step">
      <p class="step__number">06</p>
      <h2 class="step__title">Contact</h2>
      <p class="step__text">Ask at the CCIT office or the service window.</p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>

<section class="section shell">
  <div class="action-panel">
    <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/rules">Read the Terms of Use</a>
    <a class="btn btn--secondary" href="/">See service windows</a>
  </div>
</section>
